    <briefdescription>
<para>Unsupported feature or platform error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1UnsupportedError" kindref="compound">UnsupportedError</ref> represents an error where a requested feature or platform is not supported by the current build or environment.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>UnsupportedError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>UnsupportedError(&quot;ARM<sp/>platform<sp/>not<sp/>supported&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
